Package: taos-wallpapers
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: jaylfc <jaylfc25@gmail.com>
Priority: optional
Section: x11
Depends: coreutils
Description: taOS desktop wallpapers
 The approved taOS wallpaper set (neural, flow, mesh, terrain), each in dark
 and light, pre-rendered as JPEG at 3840x2160 (desktop), 3840x1200 (ultrawide)
 and 1080x2400 (phone), under /usr/share/taos/wallpapers/<id>/ with an
 index.json. The taos-wallpaper command prints the best matching file for a
 size so any compositor wallpaper tool can use it.
